        "text": "Tommy G. Faavae was appointed to the West Basin Municipal Water District board in 2025. He prioritizes protecting the water supply, expanding recycled water, fiscal responsibility, environmental justice and local jobs. He serves as business development manager for IBEW Local 11. He previously served on the Carson Environmental and Public Works Commission. His campaign says he helped secure $1.2 billion in federal funding for a renewable hydrogen initiative.",
